message: >-
  If you use these workflows or their data, please cite the Zenodo deposit below.
  The code is MIT-licensed; the datasets under data/ and the rendered site in docs/
  are CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE).
title: "MRMhub Workflow Examples: reproducible targeted LC-MS data-processing workflows"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Quarto notebooks demonstrating the MRMhub targeted LC-MS
  data-processing pipeline on real datasets, covering relative-quantification
  lipidomics at study and population scale and a fully quantitative,
  externally calibrated steroid assay validated against Agilent MassHunter.
  Provided as Supplementary Materials for the MRMhub manuscript.
type: software
